# The generator sources. The site deploys the committed HTML in the repo root;
# build/generate.cjs is run locally and its output is committed, so nothing here
# is needed at runtime. Without this Vercel serves build/**.cjs as static files,
# which published the internal pricing-policy comment in build/pages/pricing.cjs.
#
# NOTE: .gitignore and .vercelignore are separate lists. Adding a path to one
# does nothing for the other.
build/

# Local worktrees and scratch, if they ever end up inside the repo.
_wt/
scratch/
